all right good morning i'm lieutenant  ray spencer i'm the homicide lieutenant  with the las vegas metropolitan police  department  i just want to quickly recap on why  we're here this morning  so yesterday morning at around 7 30 8  o'clock in the morning  we found the body of a young juvenile  out on state route 160.  the examination of the crime scene and  the victim's body  we immediately launched a homicide  investigation  since then we have worked continuously  and around the clock  trying to identify the victim  we are not here this morning with this  announcement if it is not for the  support of the community  your viewers in the media that has  assisted us  in the coverage that this has gained  as a result of that at around one  o'clock this morning  we were contacted by a mother who  observed this sketch  that mother stated that she was  confident that the sketch that we were  showing  was her eight-year-old son  from about or probably 90 minutes i  spoke with the mother on the phone  she shared photographs of her son and  as a result of that conversation early  this morning  we sent detectives to her house along  with the coroner's office  the coroner spoke with the mother  and the mother viewed photographs of the  deceased and made a positive  identification  that the child that was found yesterday  is her eight-year-old son  we also learned that the  victim was last seen leaving his house  at approximately 9 pm on thursday  evening  what we found out is that after leaving  the house he left with his biological  father  and first i want to well  he left with his biological father they  left that residence  and picked up another child who is his  half brother  the half brother is 11 year old  eden montez m-o-n-t-e-s  his photograph is directly off to my  left  that is the last time that eden  the eight-year-old or the biological  father of both  children have been seen approximately 12  hours after the last time they were seen  is when the discovery of the  eight-year-old's body was found  out on state route 160. at this point  we are actively looking to locate  eden montez we've had no contact with  him  family members have not found or had any  contact with him  nor have we had any contact with the  father  jose montez jose montes is 37 years  of age and is a las vegas resident  i'm going to share a photograph of the  vehicle that he is believed to be  driving  it is a 2015  white gmc pickup it has a nevada license  plate with las  vegas commemorative license plate lv  you like union the number or the letter  o the letter o again in x  like x-ray we are in the process  of beginning a multi-state amber alert  for the 11 year old child  that we are actively trying to find i  urge  your viewers and i urge all of you to  please continue to do what you have done  the success that we have located the  ident or  identified the victim again as a result  of  all the viewers and citizens calling in  these tips over the last several hours  or 24 hours please  if you have any information that leads  to where this vehicle  is please call 3-1-1  if you actively see this vehicle with  this license plate  please call 9-1-1 the vehicle again has  a unique sticker on the back  that says mr express you can see that on  the right  back windshield  i do want to share we do have some tips  that are coming in  if any viewers live in the sacramento or  fresno area  please be on the lookout for this  vehicle  also any viewers in the southern or  central utah area  please be on the lookout for this  vehicle we're getting a variety of tips  he does have connections in mexico  so again any routes that would lead  through arizona or california into  mexico  again please keep your eye out for the  11 year old again please  share all this information all the  viewers please share the post the  amount of eyes that we can get would  benefit this investigation we are still  manning a 24-hour  tip line that number is 702-828-3521  and we have started a second line of  702-828-2907  with that i'll take a couple questions  but again i'm still keeping a lot of  things very close to the chest in this  investigation  sean great um amber alert's very rare  of course can you please stress why  amber alerts are very rare why  people should be paying attention right  now they are very  rare and right now we are doing  everything that we can  to locate the 11 year old child eden and  we want to locate him alive  we know that he was last with his father  and  we now know that is in the same time  frame  that we have discovered the body of his  half brother so  i i can't urge the importance of this  amber alert  and again it's going to be a multi-state  amber alert just because we need to  locate him  brianna when jose picked up eden and the  eight-year-old can you say if it was  like a normal custody exchange  or is this like a parental kidnapping  situation it is not a parental  kidnapping  situation he's the biological father of  both children  and it's not uncommon for him to  take both children for weekends  in the back did the mother anybody share  any kind of relationship details that  might give you an indication whether  there was danger  or is danger i'm not going to get into  the specifics of that but there was  nothing that  indicated there was no alarming details  prior to this that would have caused any  serious alarms but i'm not going to get  any more specific than that  all right thank you guys i appreciate it  you

